itime agency says. Iran has meanwhile said it has shot down another US drone as military tensions with Washington continue.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Bayern Munich head coach Vincent Kompany's health scare highlights the need for better support for elite coaches</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:708dd9baa45214f5591017f66d4a5e6a5a5298cc4ec6f43b4d79a9e5a8b4941c</id><updated>2026-10-29T21:14:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T07:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-head-coach-vincent-kompany-s-health-scare-highlights-the-need-for-better-support-for-e/a-79764661--fcbaed2aac2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/bayern-munich-head-coach-vincent-kompany-s-health-scare-highlights-the-need-for-better-support-for-elite-coaches/a-79764661?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Vincent Kompany’s health concern is a reminder that elite football's pressures affect coaches too. Better support, clearer structures and mental health safeguards are increasingly vital.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Spain train crash: PM Sanchez calls for investigation as 3 days of mourning begins</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec195b165add8f1709fcdb84f3ef19577b4f412e4d50eba246c56d304d5fad0e</id><updated>2026-10-29T21:14:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T07:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spain-train-crash-pm-sanchez-calls-for-investigation-as-3-days-of-mourning-begins/a-79792085--6fee42a979e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spain-train-crash-pm-sanchez-calls-for-investigation-as-3-days-of-mourning-begins/a-79792085?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Emergency crews worked through the night after a high-speed train collision killed 69 people. PM Pedro Sanchez has pledged a full investigation into Spain's second major train accident this year.</summary><c